<!-- ─────────────────────────────────── §1 The VAE Bottleneck -->
<section id="s-bottleneck" data-code="intro">
<div class="section-no">01 — The VAE Bottleneck</div>
<h2>The structural bottleneck in unified models</h2>
<p>
  Unified Multimodal Models (UMMs) aim to perform both understanding (interpreting pixels to output text) and generation (rendering text prompts into pixels) within a single shared transformer. Today, this is done by framing image generation as diffusion over the latent representations of a separately pretrained, frozen Variational Autoencoder (VAE).
</p>
<p>
  However, this reliance on an external, frozen VAE imposes a hard structural bottleneck:
</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Lossy Compression Ceiling:</strong> The VAE encoder operates under reconstruction constraints optimized separately from the UMM. Any fine details lost in the VAE's latent bottleneck can never be recovered by the UMM.</li>
  <li><strong>Disconnected Spaces:</strong> The understanding pathway (using a vision encoder like DINO or CLIP) and the generation pathway (using the VAE) remain mapped to completely separate latent spaces, hindering joint semantic training.</li>
</ul>

<div class="vp">
  <div class="vp-head">
    <div class="vp-title">architecture_comparison.svg</div>
    <div class="vp-hint">Comparison of UMM Generation Pathways</div>
  </div>
  <div class="vp-body" style="background:#0f111a; padding:1.5rem; text-align:center;">
    <svg id="arch-svg" viewBox="0 0 640 340">
      <!-- (a) VAE-based -->
      <g transform="translate(10, 10)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="620" height="90" rx="6" fill="#161b22" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="15" y="20" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10" font-family="monospace">(a) prevailing VAE-based UMM</text>
        
        <text x="30" y="52" fill="var(--text2)" font-size="11">Prompt</text>
        <line x1="75" y1="48" x2="110" y2="48" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrowPurple)"/>
        
        <rect x="115" y="30" width="160" height="36" rx="4" fill="var(--purple-dim)" stroke="var(--purple)" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="195" y="52" fill="var(--purple-l)" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">Shared Transformer</text>
        
        <line x1="280" y1="48" x2="315" y2="48" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrowPurple)"/>
        
        <rect x="320" y="30" width="110" height="36" rx="4" fill="rgba(245,158,11,.15)" stroke="var(--amber)" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="375" y="52" fill="var(--amber)" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">VAE Latents</text>
        
        <line x1="435" y1="48" x2="470" y2="48" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrowPurple)"/>
        
        <rect x="475" y="30" width="120" height="36" rx="4" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.05)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1"/>
