<p>
  By training understanding and generation in a unified representation space, RF benefits both directions.
  First, on text-to-image generation benchmarks at 1024 resolution, RF-Pixel matches state-of-the-art VAE-based unified models (like BAGEL and BLIP3-o) without using any pretrained VAE:
